sequenceDiagram
    actor Driver
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant DS as Delivery Service
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant CMS as CMS Adapter
    participant WMS as WMS Adapter
    participant RS as Route Service
    participant NS as Notifications

    note over OS, RS: Background — Route Index Maintenance
    CMS-->>OS: order status updated { orderId, status, destination }
    CMS-->>RS: order status updated { orderId, status, destination }
    note right of RS: Adds or removes order from location index based on status

    note over Driver, NS: 1 — Driver Requests Delivery Assignment
    Driver->>GW: Request Deliveries { count }
    GW->>DS: request delivery assignment { count }
    DS-->>GW: Delivery request initiated
    GW-->>Driver: Delivery request initiated

    note over DS, CMS: 2 — Fetch Oldest Pending Delivery Order
    DS-->>OS: request next pending delivery order
    OS-->>CMS: fetch next pending delivery order
    CMS-->>OS: { orderId, clientId, itemList, destination } | null
    OS-->>DS: next order response

    alt No pending orders
        DS-->>NS: notify driver — no orders available
        NS-->>Driver: WS No pending delivery orders available
    end

    note over DS, RS: 3 — Build & Optimise Delivery Route
    DS-->>RS: request optimised route { anchorOrder, count }
    note right of RS: Finds closest stops and optimises path
    RS-->>DS: optimised route [{ orderId, location }]

    note over DS, NS: 4 — Mark Orders On-Route & Notify Driver
    DS-->>OS: mark orders as collected { orderIds }

    loop For each order
        OS-->>WMS: update delivery status to on_route
        OS-->>CMS: update order status to collected
        note right of RS: RS removes collected orders from location index
    end

    OS-->>DS: orders collected
    DS-->>NS: notify driver with route
    NS-->>Driver: WS driver_route [{ orderId, location }]
